<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A3;
            margin: 60px 60px 60px 60px;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: #000;
        }

        .page-container {
            page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            min-height: 1450px;
            padding-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .title {
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .part {
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
            margin-top: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        p {
            margin: 8px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .indent {
            margin-left: 25px;
        }

        .sub-point {
            margin-left: 15px;
        }

        ul {
            margin-left: 30px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        ul li {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #666;
        }

        .seal {
            border: 3px double #0939a4;
            color: #0939a4;
            padding: 6px 15px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transform: rotate(-10deg);
            display: inline-block;
            opacity: 0.7;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        table,
        th,
        td {
            border: 1px solid black;
        }

        td {
            padding: 8px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .signature-container {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 50px;
            left: 40px;
        }

        ol {
            margin-left: 30px;
        }

        ol li {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- PAGE 1 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="title">CLIENT AGREEMENT AND TERMS AND CONDITIONS</div>
        <div class="part">PART A</div>
        <div class="section-title">INTRODUCTION</div>
        <p>This Agreement (“Agreement”) is entered into by and between:</p>
        <p class="indent">
            (a) Research Analyst (hereinafter referred to as the "RA," "We," "Our" or "Us"),
            being a person/entity duly registered with the Securities and Exchange Board of India ("SEBI")
            under Registration No. <b>INH000027779</b> and in the name of
            <b>Anujay Chouhan Proprietor of Vishtara Capitals Research</b>; and
        </p>
        <p class="indent">
            (b) Client / User (hereinafter referred to as “You,” “Your” or “the Client”),
            being the individual or legal entity subscribing to or availing of the research services
            provided by the RA, and who satisfies the eligibility criteria set out in this Agreement
            and under all applicable laws of India.
        </p>
        <p>The RA and the Client are hereinafter collectively referred to as the “Parties” and individually as a
            “Party.”</p>

        <div class="section-title">PURPOSE</div>
        <p><b>Scope and Application</b></p>
        <p class="sub-point">
            These Terms and Conditions (“T&C”) govern the Client’s access to, subscription for,
            and/or use of the research services provided by the RA (“Services”), including, without limitation,
            any digital platforms, applications, technology interfaces, or other delivery mechanisms made
            available by the RA or its authorised service provider(s) from time to time.
        </p>
        <p><b>Compliance with SEBI Circular and Regulations</b></p>
        <p class="sub-point">
            (a) These T&C incorporate the minimum mandatory provisions prescribed under
            SEBI Circular No. SEBI/HO/MIRSD/MIRSD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2025/004 dated January 08, 2025
            (the “Circular”) and the relevant amendments to the SEBI (Research Analysts) Regulations, 2014.
        </p>
        <p class="sub-point">
            (b) In the event of any conflict or inconsistency between these T&C and any applicable
            SEBI regulations, circulars, or guidelines, the provisions of such SEBI regulations, circulars,
            or guidelines shall prevail.
        </p>

        <div class="section-title">DEFINITIONS</div>
        <p>Unless the context otherwise requires, the following definitions apply in T&C:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Client or User:</b> Any person or entity that registers with the RA and agrees to these T&Cs to avail
                the Services.</li>
            <li><b>Services:</b> Research reports, data, model portfolios, analyses, advisory/research support, and
                related communications.</li>
            <li><b>Digital Platform:</b> Websites, apps, or platforms (including third-party providers) used for
                delivering services.</li>
            <li><b>KYC:</b> Know Your Customer verification process mandated by SEBI and applicable laws.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="section-title">SCOPE OF SERVICES</div>
        <p><b>Research-Only / No Execution</b></p>
        <p class="sub-point">
            You hereby agree and acknowledge that the RA provides research and analysis only
            and does not execute trades on behalf of Clients, hold Clients’ funds, or provide any assured returns.
        </p>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 1 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 2 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="section-title">No Guarantee of Returns</div>
        <ul>
            <li>You hereby agree and acknowledge that all investments carry market risk. Any past performance is not
                indicative of future returns, and the RA does not assure or promise any specific gain or outcome.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="section-title">Redistribution of Services</div>
        <ul>
            <li>You hereby agree and acknowledge that the Services are provided for your use only, and you shall not
                redistribute these Services under any circumstances, including for any commercial purpose.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="section-title">ELIGIBILITY</div>
        <p><b>Legal Capacity</b></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Only individuals who are at least 18 years of age and otherwise competent to contract under applicable
                law, or legally incorporated entities, may register.</li>
            <li>If you are a minor or otherwise not competent to enter into a contract, you are not permitted to use or
                subscribe to the Services.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><b>KYC Compliance</b></p>
        <ul>
            <li>You hereby agree and acknowledge that you shall provide accurate, complete, and up-to-date information
                for the purpose of KYC.</li>
            <li>The RA reserves the right to suspend or terminate the Services if the KYC requirements are not
                fulfilled.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="section-title">FEES & PAYMENT</div>
        <p><b>Maximum Fee for Individual/HUF Clients</b></p>
        <ul>
            <li>As per Regulation 15A of the RA Regulations and the Circular, We may charge fees up to INR 1,51,000 per
                annum per "family of client".</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 2 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 3 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="section-title">Fees for Non-Individual or Accredited Investors</div>
        <p>For non-individual clients or accredited investors fees may be negotiated bilaterally without the above
            limit.</p>
        <div class="section-title">Billing & Mode of Payment</div>
        <p>Fees may be charged yearly in advance. All payments shall be made only through secure and trackable banking
            channels.</p>
        <div class="section-title">Refund Policy</div>
        <p>In the event of premature termination, we shall refund the fees for the unexpired portion on a pro-rata
            basis.</p>

        <div class="part">PART B</div>
        <div class="section-title">MANDATORY TERMS & CONDITIONS</div>
        <p><b>1. Availing the Services</b></p>
        <p class="sub-point">By accepting delivery of the research service, the client confirms that he/she has elected
            to subscribe at his/her sole discretion.</p>
        <p><b>2. Obligations on RA</b></p>
        <p class="sub-point">RA and client shall be bound by SEBI Act and all the applicable rules and regulations of
            SEBI.</p>
        <p><b>3. Client Information & KYC</b></p>
        <p class="sub-point">The client shall furnish all such details in full as may be required by the RA.</p>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 3 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 4 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="section-title">Declaration of the RA:</div>
        <ul>
            <li>It is duly registered with SEBI as an RA (INH000018559).</li>
            <li>It has registration and qualifications required to render the services.</li>
            <li>Maximum fee for individual clients is ₹1.51 lakhs per annum.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><b>Conflict of Interest</b></p>
        <p class="sub-point">The RA shall adhere to the applicable regulations specified by SEBI in relation to
            disclosure of conflict of interest.</p>
        <div class="section-title">Termination of Service & Refund of Fees</div>
        <p class="sub-point">The RA may suspend or terminate services on account of suspension/cancellation of
            registration by SEBI.</p>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 4 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 5 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="section-title">Grievance Redressal & Dispute Resolution</div>
        <p>Any grievance related to deficiency in research services shall be escalated to the designated person (Anujay Chouhan).</p>
        <p>If unresolved, the client may escalate the complaint to SEBI via the SCORES portal.</p>

        <div class="part">PART C</div>
        <div class="section-title">Most Important Terms and Conditions (MITC)</div>
        <p><b>1.</b> RA cannot execute trades on behalf of the client.</p>
        <p><b>2.</b> Maximum fee for individuals is Rs 1,51,000 per annum per family.</p>
        <p><b>3.</b> Proportionate refund for unexpired period in case of premature termination.</p>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 5 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 6 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <p><b>4.</b> Payments must be via bank transfer/cheque. Cash is not allowed.</p>
        <p><b>5.</b> No assured/guaranteed/fixed returns are permitted by law.</p>
        <div class="section-title">Contact Details for Grievances:</div>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Customer Care Number</b></td>
                <td>+91 86020 27324</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Contact Person Name</b></td>
                <td>Anujay Chouhan</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Address</b></td>
                <td>H.no. C-20/1, Mahananda Nagar, Ujjain (M.P.), India</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Email-ID</b></td>
                <td>chouhananujay@gmail.com</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <p><b>12.</b> RA shall never ask for login credentials or OTPs. Never share such information.</p>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 6 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 7 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="part">PART D</div>
        <div class="section-title">REPRESENTATIONS & WARRANTIES</div>
        <p><b>RA’s Declarations:</b> The RA is duly registered and meets all qualification requirements.</p>
        <p><b>Client’s Declarations:</b> The Client understands the market risks and volatility.</p>
        <div class="section-title">LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</div>
        <p>We shall not be liable for any direct or indirect losses due to reliance on research reports.</p>
        <div class="section-title">INDEMNIFICATION</div>
        <p>You agree to indemnify the RA from any claims arising out of Your breach of this Agreement.</p>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 7 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 8 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="section-title">SUSPENSION & TERMINATION</div>
        <p>We may terminate this Agreement immediately upon violation of T&Cs or non-payment of fees.</p>
        <div class="section-title">MISCELLANEOUS</div>
        <p>Governing Law: Laws of India, Jurisdiction: Uttar Pradesh.</p>
        <div class="part">PART E</div>
        <div class="section-title">DISCLAIMER</div>
        <ol>
            <li>Investments are subject to market risks.</li>
            <li>Registration with SEBI doesn't guarantee returns.</li>
            <li>Fees are non-refundable (except pro-rata on termination).</li>
            <li>No profit-sharing model.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 8 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 9 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <ol start="9">
            <li>Past performance is no guarantee of future results.</li>
            <li>Recommendations are confidential for paid members only.</li>
            <li>RA has no financial interest in the subject companies.</li>
            <li>RA has not received any compensation from subject companies in the past 12 months.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="part">PART F</div>
        <div class="section-title">CLIENT CONSENT</div>
        <p class="sub-point">The Client hereby provides consent, confirming that they have thoroughly reviewed and
            comprehended the terms and conditions.</p>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 9 of 10</div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAGE 10 -->
    <div class="page-container">
        <p>... Furthermore, the Client acknowledges that they were afforded the opportunity to pose questions regarding
            the services.</p>
        <div class="part">CUSTOMER DETAILS*</div>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td width="35%"><b>Name</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= user.name %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>E-Mail</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= user.email %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Phone Number</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= user.phone || user.mobile %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>PAN Number</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= panNumber %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Aadhaar (Masked)</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= aadhaarNumber %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Amount Paid (In INR)</b></td>
                <td><b>₹<%= planAmount %></b></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Date of Agreement</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { day: '2-digit' , month: 'long' , year: 'numeric' }) %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Service Plan</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= planName %>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><b>Subscription Duration</b></td>
                <td>
                    <%= planDuration %>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <p style="font-size:11px;"><i>*Not Required in case of Digitally Signed</i></p>

        <div style="margin-top:40px; border-top:1px solid #ccc; padding-top:20px;">
            <div style="float: left; width: 60%;">
                <p><b>DIGITAL CONSENT RECORDED</b></p>
                <p>I hereby declare that I have read, understood and accepted all terms.</p>
                <p><b>Signed By:</b>
                    <%= user.name %>
                </p>
                <p><b>Aadhaar (Masked):</b>
                    <%= aadhaarNumber %>
                </p>
                <p><b>Timestamp:</b>
                    <%= timestamp %>
                </p>
            </div>
            <div style="float: right; width: 35%; text-align: center;">
                <% if (signature_base64) { %>
                    <img src="<%= signature_base64 %>" style="height:70px; mix-blend-multiply: multiply;">
                    <% } else { %>
                        <p style="font-size:11px; margin-top: 20px;">Digitally Signed</p>
                        <% } %>
                            <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #000; width:150px; margin:10px auto;"></div>
                            <p style="font-size:10px; font-weight: bold;">Authorized Signatory</p>
            </div>
            <div style="clear: both;"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="seal">Vishtara Capitals Research Analysis</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">Authorized Signature</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Page 10 of 10</div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>